    "title": "NLS wins at home to cap a winning season - NewsBreak",
    "text": "17 hours ago (New London, MN) ~ The NLS Wildcats hosted the Morris Area/Chokio-Alberta Tigers on Wednesday night, and after giving up a pick-six within the first two minutes of the game, answered with three scoring drives to go up 17-7 at the break, and then hung on for a 31-22 regular-season ending victory. Read full article",
